# Vue Component Conventions

## File Structure

- One component per file, PascalCase filename matching the component name.
- Components live under `app/components/web/<domain>/` grouped by domain, not by type.
- Atomic primitives reused by 3+ domains → `app/components/web/ui/`.
- Auto-imported as `WebDomainComponentName` (e.g. `<WebUiCta />`, `<WebHeroMainHero />`).

## Allowed Domains

`hero/`, `layout/`, `linkedin/`, `misc/`, `process/`, `social/`, `tech/`, `ui/`, `work/`

Create a new domain folder only when no existing domain fits. Never overload `misc/`.

## Script Block

- Always `<script setup lang="ts">`. No Options API. No `defineComponent`.
- Use `defineProps<{...}>()` with `withDefaults(...)` for defaults.
- Shared types live in `app/components/web/types.ts` — import via relative path:

```ts
import type { Cta, BadgeContent } from "../types";
```

## Template Block

- Single root element preferred; use semantic HTML (`<section>`, `<article>`, `<nav>`, `<header>`, `<footer>`).
- Props drive all content — no hardcoded copy (Storyblok will bind later).
- Loop with `v-for` + stable `:key`. Iterables should be typed.

## Styling

- Tailwind utility classes only. No `<style scoped>` unless absolutely necessary for non-tokenizable behavior.
- Brand tokens from `.cursor/docs/brand-style-guide.md` only — no arbitrary `[#hex]`.
- Every component must declare **both** light and `dark:` variants.
- Every layout must specify mobile-first plus `sm:` and/or `lg:` breakpoints.

## Example Skeleton

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import type { Cta } from "../types";

withDefaults(
  defineProps<{
    eyebrow: string;
    title: string;
    ctas?: Cta[];
  }>(),
  {},
);
</script>

<template>
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-purple mb-3">/ {{ eyebrow }}</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight">
      {{ title }}
    </h2>
    <div v-if="ctas?.length" class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <WebUiCta v-for="c in ctas" :key="c.href" v-bind="c" />
    </div>
  </section>
</template>
```

## Don'ts

- Don't use Options API, `data()`, or `methods`.
- Don't import components manually — rely on Nuxt auto-imports.
- Don't hardcode copy or links — accept via props.
- Don't add component-local CSS that overrides brand tokens.
